	<name>Salt</name>
	<summary>Run Roblox Studio on Linux</summary>
	<description>
		<p>Salt is a fast, open-source bootstrapper for running Roblox Studio on Linux, written in Rust. It is a rewrite of Vinegar by VinegarHQ and shares its data and configuration.</p>
	</description>
	<url type="homepage">https://github.com/Glockerz/Salt</url>
	<url type="vcs-browser">https://github.com/Glockerz/Salt</url>
